      "message": "fix(sim): cut the stock along the travelled part of the move in flight during playback\n\nPlayback showed the voxel stock cut only at the end of each G1/G2 move.\nThe move under the playhead is now cut from its start to the tool's\ndrawn position (lines and arcs, via the timeline's own point_along),\non a copy of the completed-move stock: the kept stock, checkpoints,\nverdicts and the post are unchanged, and the end of a move is the\nplain seek bit for bit. Rotary and turning ops keep whole-move display.\n\nFixes #1516\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
